{"id":"c26c22b49d5bbbe4","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-prenex.md","title":"Prenex Normal Form","display":"df-prenex — Prenex Normal Form","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-prenex","aliases":["57-df-prenex","df-prenex — Prenex Normal Form"],"display":"df-prenex — Prenex Normal Form","depends_on":["[[57-df-formula]]","[[57-df-quantifier-free]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-prenex"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-prenex</span><span>df-prenex — Prenex Normal Form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-prenex — Prenex Normal Form"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e2653d41c62cb0e\" href=\"?note=6e2653d41c62cb0e\" title=\"57-df-quantifier-free\">57-df-quantifier-free</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>、公式构造子见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QFree}\">\\(\\mathrm{QFree}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6e2653d41c62cb0e\" href=\"?note=6e2653d41c62cb0e\" title=\"57-df-quantifier-free\">57-df-quantifier-free</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec q\">\\(\\vec q\\)</span> 是有限量词—变量对列。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pref}\">\\(\\mathrm{Pref}\\)</span> 按列长递归。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Pref}(\\langle\\rangle,\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\psi,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Pref}(\\langle(Q,x)\\rangle\\frown\\vec q,\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq Qx\\,\\mathrm{Pref}(\\vec q,\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PNF}(\\varphi)&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec q\\in(\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\times\\mathrm{Var})^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\\n(\\varphi=\\mathrm{Pref}(\\vec q,\\psi)\\land\\mathrm{QFree}(\\psi)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Pref}(\\langle\\rangle,\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\psi,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Pref}(\\langle(Q,x)\\rangle\\frown\\vec q,\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq Qx\\,\\mathrm{Pref}(\\vec q,\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PNF}(\\varphi)&amp;\\longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec q\\in(\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\times\\mathrm{Var})^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\\n(\\varphi=\\mathrm{Pref}(\\vec q,\\psi)\\land\\mathrm{QFree}(\\psi)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>PNF 判定当前公式本身的语法形状，不把“存在与它等价的前束公式”误写成前束形状谓词。允许空前缀和重复绑定变量；需变量改名的定理另列新鲜性条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-quantifier-free","status":"resolved","id":"6e2653d41c62cb0e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-quantifier-free]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$、$\\mathrm{Var}$、公式构造子见 [[57-df-formula]]；$\\mathrm{QFree}$ 见 [[57-df-quantifier-free]]。$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}$、$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$，$\\vec q$ 是有限量词—变量对列。$\\mathrm{Pref}$ 按列长递归。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-quantifier-free","status":"resolved","id":"6e2653d41c62cb0e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$、$\\mathrm{Var}$、公式构造子见 [[57-df-formula]]；$\\mathrm{QFree}$ 见 [[57-df-quantifier-free]]。$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}$、$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$，$\\vec q$ 是有限量词—变量对列。$\\mathrm{Pref}$ 按列长递归。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QFree}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pref}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Pref}(\\langle\\rangle,\\psi)&\\coloneqq\\psi,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Pref}(\\langle(Q,x)\\rangle\\frown\\vec q,\\psi)&\\coloneqq Qx\\,\\mathrm{Pref}(\\vec q,\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PNF}(\\varphi)&\\longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec q\\in(\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\times\\mathrm{Var})^{<\\omega}\\\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\\n(\\varphi=\\mathrm{Pref}(\\vec q,\\psi)\\land\\mathrm{QFree}(\\psi)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1209,"backlinks":[{"id":"b1739a7dc0b811d9","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\langle(Q_1,x_1),\\ldots,(Q_n,x_n)\\rangle\\in(\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\times\\mathrm{Var})^n$；$\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，$\\mathrm{QFree}(\\psi)$，见 [[57-df-quantifier-free]]。$\\varphi=\\mathrm{Pref}(\\langle(Q_1,x_1),\\ldots,(Q_n,x_n)\\rangle,\\psi)$，$\\mathrm{Pref}$ 取 [[57-df-prenex]]。这里读取当前语法树的完整量词前缀，不任意选择一个与 φ 等价的前束公式；空前缀和重复绑定变量均保留。"},{"id":"2c0620d37f6063ea","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$；$\\mathrm{Pref}$ 见 [[57-df-prenex]]，量词秩 $\\mathrm{qr}$ 见 [[57-df-quantifier-rank]]。本条目保留同名 PNF 接口，是同一前束形状谓词的量词秩写法。"},{"id":"a9a7faa02ecae403","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"43b2728e68e05836","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi=\\mathrm{Pref}(\\langle(Q_1,x_1),\\ldots,(Q_n,x_n)\\rangle,\\psi)$，$\\mathrm{QFree}(\\psi)$；$x_1,\\ldots,x_n$ 两两不同，$Q_i\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}$。这是本算子的输入域，前缀取直到无量词矩阵的完整前缀，见 [[57-df-prenex]]。"},{"id":"d8ad50b1bb4a4cb1","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 是有效的有限纯关系语言：无常量、正元函数及零元关系符号；允许逻辑等号。$g$ 是 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的有效语法编码，$\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$\\mathrm{Pref}$ 取 [[57-df-prenex]]，$\\mathrm{QF}_S$ 取 [[57-df-quantifier-free]]；$\\mathrm{Sat}(\\{\\sigma\\})$ 是该单句的可满足性。$\\mathrm{Dec}_{\\mathbb N}$ 是数集可判定类，不是 [[57-df-decidable-theory]] 的理论类 Dec；其与 $\\mathrm{Rec}$ 的关系在下式明示。"},{"id":"9d397b06fae0a322","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-133","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-bound-variable]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-